{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"better\": \"X\",\n  \"regress\": \"有：S01、S05等短停留段的感受词仍然偏密，部分水波、船、失重意象重复，容易让观众来不及消化；Y在这些地方更利落。\",\n  \"nets\": {\n    \"scan\": \"X\",\n    \"point\": \"X\",\n    \"why\": \"Y\",\n    \"whole\": \"X\",\n    \"fine\": \"X\"\n  },\n  \"why\": \"X的关键词放大加亮，让观众不必读完每句话就能抓住人物心思的变化；感受词又能随音乐实际出现，把听觉变化和心理活动对应起来。Y的完整句子在解释人物行为的因果关系时更自然，但右侧短词同时铺开，容易变成对情绪的静态罗列。X的水波、小船、摇荡、未能靠岸等意象反复呼应，加上更具体的音色、声部和乐句变化，让整段经历更像一件持续发展的事情，而不只是十四段情绪说明。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "79fbd764-e498-4696-807b-7c784bcc36f0", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261108T044902516032Z", "elapsed_seconds": 110.734, "completed_utc": "2026-11-08T04:50:53.263921+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "3f00f17f72089f522f3b20b40ad979d44afc8a9f5a36a74bab4de3a8604e3301", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt